<title>TUNISIA: PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Aug 5.</title>
<headline>PRESS DIGEST - Tunisia - Aug 5.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>These are the leading stories in the Tunisian press on Tuesday. Reuters has not verified these stories and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>LA PRESSE</p>
<p>- President Ben Ali chairs cabinet meeting to assess financial cooperation with foreign countries.</p>
<p>- French Foreign Minister Hubert Vedrine expects Ben Ali visit to France will reinforce partnership.</p>
<p>LE TEMPS</p>
<p>- Foreign Minister Zouari meets visiting French counterpart on bilateral cooperation.</p>
</text>
